// IR migration: selector rule generation was removed.
// XFAIL: *
// A flag read vetoes a value rule only when it feeds the defined operand: a
// rotate whose carry output conditionally preserves its old value keeps its
// value rule. The exact conditional flag semantics still reach `execute()`,
// and a complete definer still fuses with the flag-guarded branch.

// RUN: tmdlc --action=emit-rust --dialect=test --output=- %S/../Inputs/flag-value-rules.tmdl | filecheck %s

// The conditionally-preserving definer executes its flag read.
// CHECK: "cmppreserve",
// CHECK: tir::backend::exec::SymSource::FixedRegister("FLAGS", 0)

// CHECK: static RULE_ROTLIKE
// CHECK: static RULE_BRANCHEQ_VIA_CMP
